Vendored vocabulary data — sources, licences, and modifications
==============================================================

The files in this directory are DERIVED SUBSETS of public biomedical ontologies. The evidence-graph
source code is Apache-2.0; this data is not, and each source keeps its own licence and requires its
own attribution. Built 2026-09-14 by scripts/build_vocabulary.py.

MODIFICATIONS (stated because CC BY 4.0 section 3(a)(1)(B) requires it)
----------------------------------------------------------------------
Every file here is a reformatted subset, not an original release. For each source we kept only the
identifier, the primary label, and EXACT-scope synonyms, and wrote them as gzipped TSV. Obsolete
terms were removed from the forward index and retained separately in redirects.tsv.gz. Ontology
structure — definitions, cross-references, and the class hierarchy — was discarded. ChEBI was
additionally filtered to curation level 2 stars and above. No term text was altered, except that
HTML markup was stripped from ChEBI names and escaped quotes were unescaped in OBO synonyms.

Do not treat these files as authoritative releases. Cite the upstream sources below.

